WEBVTT

00:03.740 --> 00:06.310
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.490 --> 00:10.420
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.430 --> 00:14.020
What he is?

00:14.210 --> 00:18.600
What he wants?

00:22.270 --> 00:29.680
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.680 --> 00:34.750
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:37.030 --> 00:44.010
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.430 --> 00:51.880
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.680 --> 00:57.170
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.390 --> 01:00.680
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:01.030 --> 01:04.530
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.750 --> 01:08.110
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.410 --> 01:11.940
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:12.140 --> 01:15.490
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.810 --> 01:19.330
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:19.330 --> 01:24.240
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:30.750 --> 01:35.410
Power Up!

01:41.660 --> 01:42.990
Tobio...

01:43.380 --> 01:44.570
Tobio...

01:45.420 --> 01:47.450
Fa-ther?

02:09.080 --> 02:10.690
Awaken!

02:10.870 --> 02:14.500
Science gave birth to the Ultimate Robot!

02:15.830 --> 02:17.330
Robot?

02:31.660 --> 02:32.930
Wh-what's wrong?

02:33.080 --> 02:34.450
Not enough energy!

02:34.470 --> 02:35.690
What?!

02:35.770 --> 02:40.330
Isn't all the energy here
going into that capsule?!

02:40.350 --> 02:41.940
It's just not enough!

02:42.150 --> 02:44.180
Contact the energy plant!

02:44.290 --> 02:47.780
Collect all the energy of Metal City!

02:48.070 --> 02:52.100
Just a little more and
that robot will awaken!

02:57.970 --> 02:59.130
Emergency notice!

02:59.150 --> 02:59.790
Yup!

03:00.180 --> 03:02.740
All of the city's energy supply is needed.

03:02.800 --> 03:04.290
Switch the pipes.

03:04.510 --> 03:06.040
That'll be dangerous!

03:06.220 --> 03:07.740
It's an order from above!

03:07.970 --> 03:09.880
Just carry out the order!

03:10.160 --> 03:11.110
Roger!

03:11.580 --> 03:13.890
Gear 1 Mode Change.

03:43.430 --> 03:45.620
The memories are bitter, Ochanomizu...

03:45.980 --> 03:47.810
Awaken!

03:48.230 --> 03:49.690
Me?

03:50.130 --> 03:51.670
Are you calling me?

03:56.910 --> 03:58.590
Oh, oh no!

03:58.840 --> 03:59.800
Stop!

03:59.960 --> 04:01.880
Give up on the robot!

04:06.800 --> 04:08.190
Come back right now!

04:08.410 --> 04:09.690
Everyone...

04:10.100 --> 04:12.490
This kid is going to be born!

05:13.270 --> 05:14.900
You've awaken?

05:15.060 --> 05:18.500
Tobio, no, you were just born!

05:18.600 --> 05:20.440
Your name is...

05:23.610 --> 05:25.120
Atom...

05:26.020 --> 05:29.140
Right, you're Atom!

05:30.560 --> 05:33.260
All systems back to normal.

05:33.710 --> 05:35.840
Delivering Metal City's energy.

05:37.300 --> 05:39.430
Man, that was way too reckless!

05:39.590 --> 05:42.980
If these power surges occur frequently,
what'll I do?

05:47.320 --> 05:49.420
I want to hurry and see it.

05:49.420 --> 05:51.280
The ultimate robot...

05:51.510 --> 05:54.970
Cybernetics sure has advanced
further than expected.

05:54.970 --> 05:56.450
I'm looking forward to it.

06:03.840 --> 06:06.000
Good Atom, that's it!

06:09.170 --> 06:11.250
So, what do you think Atom?

06:13.000 --> 06:15.450
Where's the ultimate robot?

06:15.500 --> 06:18.250
All I see is a regular kid...

06:18.480 --> 06:23.020
This is the world's first robot
that's just like a human.

06:23.070 --> 06:27.860
That's why he's like a human child.

06:28.120 --> 06:31.230
Why didn't you just program
him from the beginning?

06:31.310 --> 06:33.570
Does this robot have any practical use?

06:33.740 --> 06:35.710
You guys don't understand!

06:35.790 --> 06:38.090
If a robot has a human mind...

06:38.090 --> 06:40.280
Then they'll finally be real friends...

06:40.280 --> 06:41.620
Anyway...

06:41.840 --> 06:43.320
This is kid stuff...

06:43.380 --> 06:47.680
If we're done, I'm going back to my shop.

06:48.090 --> 06:51.730
This kid will change robot history,
he's the ultimate robot!

06:56.140 --> 06:57.350
That's what I think...

06:57.880 --> 06:58.600
Boss!

07:00.280 --> 07:01.540
What is it?

07:01.850 --> 07:04.710
Return to main controls.

07:05.230 --> 07:07.870
You're already 40 seconds late!

07:08.190 --> 07:09.690
But Atom...

07:09.810 --> 07:11.690
Leave it to Robita!

07:12.480 --> 07:13.380
Y-yes sir!

07:14.120 --> 07:15.590
Well, well, Robita.

07:15.870 --> 07:17.420
Take care of Atom.

07:17.670 --> 07:18.580
You can rely on me.

07:18.780 --> 07:20.480
Atom, I'm...

07:20.480 --> 07:21.490
Hurry!

07:21.550 --> 07:23.460
I'm coming, I am, I am...

07:23.460 --> 07:24.870
I get it!

07:24.870 --> 07:27.240
Be a good kid Atom!

07:28.580 --> 07:30.520
Alright, let's continue studying.

07:30.990 --> 07:33.580
Robot are humans...

07:39.890 --> 07:43.560
Hey, Atom, watch out, watch out!

07:46.960 --> 07:49.100
No, no, no!

07:50.040 --> 07:51.720
Danger! Danger!

07:53.430 --> 07:55.520
Atom, don't!

07:55.520 --> 07:56.740
No! No!

07:57.310 --> 07:58.280
Got you!

08:03.520 --> 08:05.420
First, never do it again!

08:05.760 --> 08:08.440
The damage from collecting
all the energy is still being fixed!

08:08.640 --> 08:11.760
If you ever do it again, I'll file a report!

08:13.330 --> 08:15.070
Well, well, I lose...

08:15.880 --> 08:17.020
Let me in!

08:17.730 --> 08:18.760
Hey wait!

08:19.700 --> 08:21.830
I'm Metal City Cop Tawachi!

08:23.200 --> 08:25.530
I've come to ask you about the disaster.

08:26.250 --> 08:27.580
Well, that's...

08:52.030 --> 08:53.320
Wait!

08:58.590 --> 09:00.770
A robot with a mind?

09:00.950 --> 09:05.080
Yes, it's completely free
to choose its actions.

09:05.250 --> 09:06.320
The world's first...

09:07.330 --> 09:08.360
That's dangerous!

09:08.610 --> 09:10.250
A robot acting on it's own!

09:10.290 --> 09:12.580
Atom's a good kid who'll obey rules!

09:12.950 --> 09:13.850
Settle down!

09:13.850 --> 09:14.930
He's a good kid!

09:16.530 --> 09:17.410
Atom!

09:20.150 --> 09:21.870
Atom!

09:25.210 --> 09:26.810
Atom!

09:50.560 --> 09:51.620
I'm flying, flying!

09:51.960 --> 09:53.190
Flying!

10:09.730 --> 10:11.000
Thanks for waiting.

10:34.680 --> 10:35.900
That was surprising...

10:41.770 --> 10:42.900
Hi!

10:57.100 --> 10:58.390
This sure is fun!

11:03.170 --> 11:05.750
Can't he just stay in one place?

11:06.100 --> 11:09.190
I'm even more worried now that he's flying.

11:12.320 --> 11:15.530
Right, it's urgent, catch that robot boy!

11:16.850 --> 11:19.260
Abnormality in the Main Energy Pipe.

11:19.910 --> 11:21.610
Send the maintenance hang!

11:21.890 --> 11:22.360
Roger!

11:22.680 --> 11:26.710
Maintenance hang, activated,
abnormality in the waste section.

11:36.020 --> 11:38.210
Emergency! Emergency!

11:54.220 --> 11:55.350
Father!

12:06.590 --> 12:07.560
Robot?

12:08.210 --> 12:10.340
Who are you?! You surprised us!

12:10.600 --> 12:12.340
Can I walk with you?

12:15.790 --> 12:17.220
Maybe for a little bit.

12:17.520 --> 12:18.150
Hey!

12:18.230 --> 12:19.700
Be like this.

12:19.900 --> 12:21.840
1, 2, 1, 2...

12:22.100 --> 12:23.380
Understand? Try it!

12:24.180 --> 12:27.290
Like this? 1, 2, 1, 2...

12:27.410 --> 12:28.770
STOP!

12:30.890 --> 12:31.970
Father!

12:32.110 --> 12:33.990
Don't be violent to my father!

12:34.150 --> 12:35.790
I-I'm sorry...

12:36.630 --> 12:37.790
Are you okay father?

12:37.790 --> 12:39.660
What a strange robot...

12:40.080 --> 12:41.560
Ah, that was scary.

12:49.080 --> 12:51.530
All the energy has been cut off!

12:51.620 --> 12:53.280
That's why I said it was too reckless!

12:53.750 --> 12:56.040
What the heck is happening?!

13:04.290 --> 13:05.460
Keep going!

13:06.990 --> 13:08.470
Hey, hey, what are you doing?

13:08.760 --> 13:10.110
Please stay back!

13:10.820 --> 13:12.270
Seems interesting!

13:12.270 --> 13:12.990
Let me do it!

13:12.990 --> 13:13.810
We can't!

13:15.690 --> 13:17.860
We're not playing, this is work!

13:18.040 --> 13:18.780
Work?

13:19.290 --> 13:20.670
Why are you working?

13:21.290 --> 13:24.190
We work so the humans
can enjoy a peaceful world.

13:24.590 --> 13:26.530
That is our duty as robots.

13:27.070 --> 13:28.530
Robot's duty?

13:31.370 --> 13:32.550
Wh-what's going on?!

13:32.650 --> 13:34.750
A lot of energy, ow ow ow!

13:35.750 --> 13:36.500
What?!

13:36.790 --> 13:38.880
It only happened once!

13:39.010 --> 13:40.120
Didn't you know?!

13:40.450 --> 13:41.850
Your predecessor was
sure eploiting the core!

13:42.070 --> 13:44.280
The core wasn't capable of doing that!

13:44.400 --> 13:47.110
What, that happened?!

13:47.320 --> 13:50.750
It wasn't that much energy for the core...

13:51.380 --> 13:52.080
No!

13:54.310 --> 13:55.390
What's wrong?!

13:55.440 --> 13:57.790
The core, it's started to move!

14:21.400 --> 14:22.520
It's my fault!

14:22.840 --> 14:24.390
I have to hurry and do something!

14:48.760 --> 14:52.190
What, that's the core?!

15:17.110 --> 15:19.080
Save me!

15:21.130 --> 15:21.800
Professor!

15:21.930 --> 15:23.000
I'm saved...

15:23.060 --> 15:24.250
I have to go!

15:50.510 --> 15:53.030
I'm going to stop that robot's violence!

15:53.470 --> 15:54.270
Atom!

15:57.900 --> 15:59.080
This is a power crisis!

15:59.750 --> 16:02.430
The core right now has powered up
and gone berserk.

16:03.300 --> 16:06.210
Don't let it get by!

16:07.850 --> 16:10.160
We cannot let it pass this bridge!

16:13.470 --> 16:15.910
I'm not going to let
a robot destroy my town!

16:16.310 --> 16:17.750
Where is it now?!

16:17.890 --> 16:19.670
Underground, it's heading this way!

16:20.170 --> 16:21.040
Underground?

16:35.300 --> 16:35.920
FIRE!

16:35.920 --> 16:37.670
FIRE! FIRE!

16:41.220 --> 16:43.570
The core is absorbing the energy!

16:43.890 --> 16:46.310
It's just getting stronger!

16:46.970 --> 16:47.890
Like this...

16:50.860 --> 16:53.030
Robots, again!

17:09.790 --> 17:11.270
Don't be violent!

17:11.510 --> 17:12.790
It's inconveniencing everyone!

17:21.200 --> 17:22.100
RETREAT!

17:33.880 --> 17:35.210
A-Atom!

17:55.400 --> 17:56.380
Atom...

17:59.520 --> 18:01.220
Get the energy cannon!

18:01.990 --> 18:04.070
We're going to protect Metal City!

18:04.070 --> 18:07.330
No! If it blows up,
the town will be destroyed!

18:08.660 --> 18:10.400
Get ready to attack!

18:12.520 --> 18:13.480
Stop!

18:13.590 --> 18:14.560
FIRE!

18:14.610 --> 18:15.780
Wait!

18:18.120 --> 18:21.020
You can't fire, it'll explode!

18:21.320 --> 18:22.100
What?!

18:27.310 --> 18:28.180
What?

18:28.580 --> 18:29.520
Atom!

18:41.040 --> 18:42.040
Wow!

18:42.190 --> 18:44.410
He's weird, but amazing!

18:50.440 --> 18:53.080
Wow, his body is so small, but...

19:01.270 --> 19:03.470
Painful...

19:04.360 --> 19:06.700
It's painful...

19:07.120 --> 19:07.690
You...

19:08.090 --> 19:08.710
It's you?

19:09.730 --> 19:10.460
I...

19:10.620 --> 19:12.460
You can understand me?

19:12.610 --> 19:15.060
Please, help me!

19:15.560 --> 19:16.260
Okay!

19:16.920 --> 19:18.540
But if I do, no more violence!

19:19.050 --> 19:21.260
I didn't mean to be violent...

19:21.440 --> 19:25.590
I had so much energy that I was in pain...

19:28.630 --> 19:30.570
What's that? That noise...

19:31.570 --> 19:33.900
Then I'll take your energy for you!

19:34.220 --> 19:35.250
Really?

19:41.000 --> 19:41.670
Okay!

19:44.840 --> 19:45.690
Atom!

19:51.440 --> 19:54.640
The core's energy is
getting absorbed by Atom!

19:54.950 --> 19:57.850
If you do that, you'll get sick Atom!

20:08.040 --> 20:09.780
Alright, let's go home!

20:13.730 --> 20:14.990
Atom did...

20:15.480 --> 20:17.450
He saved the core...

20:18.340 --> 20:22.470
That tiny body took all
of the core's energy.

20:24.650 --> 20:26.050
Core returned.

20:26.320 --> 20:27.380
Unbelievable!

20:27.490 --> 20:30.010
Oh, restore the system, hurry!

20:38.290 --> 20:39.600
System operating!

20:42.760 --> 20:45.390
Thank goodness that
you're not in pain anymore.

20:49.650 --> 20:50.960
Then, see you later!

21:08.440 --> 21:13.110
I see, the excess energy
is getting discarded as light.

21:17.030 --> 21:19.200
Pretty, it's like a star!

21:19.510 --> 21:20.790
An Astro Boy!

21:23.430 --> 21:25.400
Atom, let's go home!

21:26.140 --> 21:28.030
Profesor Ochanomizu!

21:28.630 --> 21:29.660
Look! Look!

21:32.950 --> 21:34.580
Man, he's just a kid.

21:35.180 --> 21:42.250
But, I didn't teach him anything, and
he still saved the humans and a robot.

21:42.670 --> 21:46.750
That kid will probably be the bridge
between humans and robots.

21:51.130 --> 21:51.890
Tobio...

21:53.180 --> 21:55.430
You are... Tobio!

22:12.040 --> 22:17.570
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:17.970 --> 22:23.180
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.560 --> 22:29.070
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:29.350 --> 22:34.650
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:35.010 --> 22:40.290
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:40.770 --> 22:48.930
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:49.330 --> 22:52.210
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.420 --> 23:00.420
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:01.010 --> 23:03.420
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:03.850 --> 23:12.130
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.430 --> 23:17.160
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:23.890 --> 23:27.100
The Robot Ball is very popular right now in Metal City.

23:27.440 --> 23:30.200
But the star player Harley is acting strange!

23:30.310 --> 23:31.840
What's wrong Harley?

23:32.230 --> 23:34.430
Next time! Robot Ball!

23:34.620 --> 23:37.150
With your heart... Catch the future!
